        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset Classic Polo Ball Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPerfect for any type of home be it traditional or contemporary, the Polo Knob is made from one piece of brass. The rounded ball design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. The Polo Round Knob with matching rose is a great choice. It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Polo Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey system.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Polo Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/IVES-580-Specifications.gif?v=1704354537\" width=\"473\" height=\"94\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset P Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
