                "description": "Kwikset Polo Knobset - Perfect for any type of home be it traditional or contemporary, the Polo Knob is made from one piece of brass. The rounded ball design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. The Polo Round Knob with matching rose is a great choice. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.",
